 response←request ReturnDependencyFiles packageIDs;json;data;html;qdmx;packageID;filename;list
⍝ Returns config files or ⍬ for every packageID hosted.\\
⍝ With JSON, packages not hosted are simply not mentioned. Only when none of them is hosted a 404 is returned.
⍝ (Until 0.127.0 a single package not hosted caused a 404, and clients silently lost the others)
 :Trap Reg.ErrorNo
     :If IsJsonRequest request.Headers
         list←{','∊⍵:','(≠⊆⊢)⍵ ⋄ ⊆⍵}packageIDs
         :If ~∨/F.IsDir G.RegistryPath∘,¨list
             response←request Respond 404 0
             response.Content←'Not found: ',⊃{⍺,',',⍵}/list
         :Else
             json←ReturnDependencyFiles_ packageIDs
             response←R.NewResponse request
             response.Content←json
         :EndIf
     :Else
         packageID←packageIDs               ⍝ For HTML it's a single one for sure
         filename←G.RegistryPath,packageID,'/',Reg.DependenciesFilename
         :If F.IsFile filename
             data←⊃F.NGET filename 1
             html←PrepareHtmlPageForDependencies data(request GetCanonicalLink packageID)
             response←request ReturnHTML html
         :Else
             response←request Respond 404 1
         :EndIf
     :EndIf
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     response←request Respond 400 0
     response.Content←qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap
⍝Done
